{"id":"H5070","lemma":"נָדָב","transliteration":"nadav","sayIt":"na-DAV","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Nadab","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exo.6.23;\nson of: Aaron (H0175) and Elisheba (H0472);\nbrother of: Abihu (H0030), Eleazar (H0499) and Ithamar (H0385)\n§ Nadab = \"generous\"\n1) eldest son of Aaron by Elisheba; struck dead before the sanctuary in the wilderness for kindling the censers with strange fire\n2) son of king Jeroboam I of the northern kingdom of Israel and king of Israel for 2 years before being slain by Baasha\n3) a Jerahmeelite, son of Shammai, of the tribe of Judah\n4) a son of Gibeon of the tribe of Benjamin","glosses":["nadab","abihu","and","while nadab"],"count":20,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"exo-6","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"and","kjv":"him Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"exo-24","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abihu","kjv":"Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"exo-24","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"exo-28","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Abihu","kjv":"Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"lev-10","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"And Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"num-3","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"num-3","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"And Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":60,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":61,"renderings":{"bsb":"but Nadab","kjv":"And Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-14","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"and Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-15","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"And Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-15","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"while Nadab","kjv":"for Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-15","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Nadab","kjv":"of Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Nadab","kjv":"of Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"and Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"Nadab","kjv":"and Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"were Nadab","kjv":"Nadab"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"But Nadab","kjv":"But Nadab"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Exodus 6:23","note":"Aaron took Elisheba, the daughter of Amminadab, the sister of Nahshon, as his wife; and she bore him Nadab and Abihu, Eleazar and Ithamar.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Leviticus 10:1","note":"Nadab and Abihu, the sons of Aaron, each took his censer, and put fire in it, and laid incense on it, and offered strange fire before Yahweh, which he had not…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 3:2","note":"These are the names of the sons of Aaron: Nadab the firstborn, and Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Kings 14:20","note":"The days which Jeroboam reigned were twenty two years, then he slept with his fathers, and Nadab his son reigned in his place.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:28","note":"The sons of Onam were Shammai and Jada. The sons of Shammai: Nadab and Abishur.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H5369","lemma":"נֵר","transliteration":"ner","gloss":"Ner"},{"id":"H0022","lemma":"אֲבִיאֵל","transliteration":"aviel","gloss":"Abiel"},{"id":"H0029","lemma":"אֲבִיָּה","transliteration":"aviyyah","gloss":"Abijah"},{"id":"H0030","lemma":"אֲבִיהוּא","transliteration":"avihu","gloss":"Abihu"},{"id":"H0051","lemma":"אֲבִישׁוּר","transliteration":"avishur","gloss":"Abishur"},{"id":"H0175","lemma":"אַהֲרֹן","transliteration":"aharon","gloss":"Aaron"},{"id":"H0283","lemma":"אַחְיוֹ","transliteration":"achyo","gloss":"Ahio"},{"id":"H0385","lemma":"אִיתָמָר","transliteration":"itamar","gloss":"Ithamar"}],"senses":[{"id":"H5070H","gloss":"Nadab","relation":"H5070H ="},{"id":"H5070I","gloss":"Nadab","relation":"H5070I ="},{"id":"H5070J","gloss":"Nadab","relation":"H5070J ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG 